  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 611.07 Hazardous Waste Contaminated Soil Storage, Treatment, and Disposal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 611.07 Hazardous Waste Contaminated Soil Storage, Treatment, and Disposal. Soils characterized as a hazardous waste shall be stored, treated, and disposed of in accordance with RSA 147-A and Env-Hw 100 – 1400.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
